{"suttaId":"tha-ap45","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[3648,3698],"vripara":"54"},"segments":{"tha-ap45:0.3":"Kāḷigodhāputtabhaddiyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap45:1.1":"“Padumuttarasambuddhaṃ, mettacittaṃ mahāmuniṃ;","tha-ap45:1.3":"Upeti janatā sabbā, sabbalokagganāyakaṃ.","tha-ap45:2.1":"“Sattukañca baddhakañca [vatthaṃ senāsanañceva (sī.), sattukañca padakañca (sī. aṭṭha.), sattukañca pavākañca (syā.)], āmisaṃ pānabhojanaṃ;","tha-ap45:2.3":"Dadanti satthuno sabbe, puññakkhette anuttare.","tha-ap45:3.1":"“Ahampi dānaṃ dassāmi, devadevassa tādino;","tha-ap45:3.3":"Buddhaseṭṭhaṃ nimantetvā, saṅghampi ca anuttaraṃ.","tha-ap45:4.1":"“Uyyojitā mayā cete, nimantesuṃ tathāgataṃ;","tha-ap45:4.3":"Kevalaṃ bhikkhusaṅghañca, puññakkhettaṃ anuttaraṃ.","tha-ap45:5.1":"“Satasahassapallaṅkaṃ, sovaṇṇaṃ gonakatthataṃ;","tha-ap45:5.3":"Tūlikāpaṭalikāya, khomakappāsikehi ca;","tha-ap45:5.5":"Mahārahaṃ paññāpayiṃ, āsanaṃ buddhayuttakaṃ.","tha-ap45:6.1":"“Padumuttaro lokavidū, devadevo narāsabho;","tha-ap45:6.3":"Bhikkhusaṅghaparibyūḷho, mama dvāramupāgami.","tha-ap45:7.1":"“Paccuggantvāna sambuddhaṃ, lokanāthaṃ yasassinaṃ;","tha-ap45:7.3":"Pasannacitto sumano, abhināmayiṃ saṅgharaṃ [sakaṃ gharaṃ (sī.)].","tha-ap45:8.1":"“Bhikkhūnaṃ satasahassaṃ, buddhañca lokanāyakaṃ;","tha-ap45:8.3":"Pasannacitto sumano, paramannena tappayiṃ.","tha-ap45:9.1":"“Padumuttaro lokavidū, āhutīnaṃ paṭiggaho;","tha-ap45:9.3":"Bhikkhusaṅghe nisīditvā, imā gāthā abhāsatha.","tha-ap45:10.1":"“‘Yenidaṃ āsanaṃ dinnaṃ, sovaṇṇaṃ gonakatthataṃ;","tha-ap45:10.3":"Tamahaṃ kittayissāmi, suṇātha mama bhāsato.","tha-ap45:11.1":"“‘Catusattatikkhattuṃ so, devarajjaṃ karissati;","tha-ap45:11.3":"Anubhossati sampattiṃ, accharāhi purakkhato.","tha-ap45:12.1":"“‘Padesarajjaṃ sahassaṃ, vasudhaṃ āvasissati;","tha-ap45:12.3":"Ekapaññāsakkhattuñca, cakkavattī bhavissati.","tha-ap45:13.1":"“‘Sabbāsu bhavayonīsu, uccākulī [uccākule (ka.)] bhavissati;","tha-ap45:13.3":"So ca pacchā pabbajitvā, sukkamūlena codito;","tha-ap45:13.5":"Bhaddiyo nāma nāmena, hessati satthu sāvako.","tha-ap45:14.1":"“‘Vivekamanuyuttomhi, pantasenanivāsahaṃ;","tha-ap45:14.3":"Phalañcādhigataṃ sabbaṃ, cattaklesomhi ajjahaṃ.","tha-ap45:15.1":"“‘Mama sabbaṃ [kammaṃ (?)] abhiññāya, sabbaññū lokanāyako;","tha-ap45:15.3":"Bhikkhusaṅghe nisīditvā, etadagge ṭhapesi maṃ’.","tha-ap45:16.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap45:17.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā bhaddiyo kāḷigodhāya putto thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap45:18.1":"Bhaddiyassa kāḷigodhāya puttattherassāpadānaṃ tatiyaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":2502,"to":2504,"paras":[{"para":2502,"vripara":"54","refs":["tha-ap45:1"],"words":["padumuttarasambuddhaṃ","mettacittaṃ","mahāmuniṃ","janatā sabbā","sabbalokagganāyakaṃ","upeti"],"lines":["So arahā hutvā attano pubbakammaṃ saritvā somanassajāto pubbacaritāpadānaṃ pakāsento <b>padumuttarasambuddhan</b>tiādimāha.","Taṃ heṭṭhā vuttatthameva.","<b>Mettacittan</b>ti mijjati sinehati nandati sabbasatteti mettā, mettāya sahagataṃ cittaṃ mettacittaṃ, taṃ yassa bhagavato atthīti mettacitto, taṃ mettacittaṃ.","<b>Mahāmunin</b>ti sakalabhikkhūnaṃ mahantattā mahāmuni, taṃ padumuttaraṃ sambuddhanti sambandho.","<b>Janatā sabbā</b>ti sabbo janakāyo, sabbanagaravāsinoti attho.","<b>Sabbalokagganāyakan</b>ti sakalalokassa aggaṃ seṭṭhaṃ nibbānassa nayanato pāpanato nāyakaṃ padumuttarasambuddhaṃ janatā <b>upeti</b> samīpaṃ gacchatīti sambandho."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap45:1"],["tha-ap45:1"],["tha-ap45:1"],["tha-ap45:1"],["tha-ap45:1"],["tha-ap45:1"]]},{"para":2503,"vripara":"55","refs":["tha-ap45:2"],"words":["sattukañca baddhakañcā","āmisaṃ"],"lines":["<b>Sattukañca baddhakañcā</b>ti baddhasattuabaddhasattusaṅkhātaṃ <b>āmisaṃ</b>.","Atha vā bhattapūpakhajjabhojjayāguādayo yāvakālikattā <b>āmisaṃ</b> pānabhojanañca gahetvā puññakkhette anuttare satthuno dadantīti sambandho."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap45:2"],["tha-ap45:2"]]},{"para":2504,"vripara":"58","refs":["tha-ap45:5"],"words":["āsanaṃ buddhayuttakaṃ"],"lines":["<b>Āsanaṃ buddhayuttakan</b>ti buddhayoggaṃ buddhārahaṃ buddhānucchavikaṃ sattaratanamayaṃ āsananti attho.","Sesaṃ nayānuyogena suviññeyyamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap45:5"],["tha-ap45:5"]]}]},"tika":null}
